.SH NAME
le-forward - kubectl port-forward with auto-reconnect


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBle forward TARGET [PORT:PORT ...] [kubectl flags] [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Supervise a \fBkubectl port-forward\fR session: raw kubectl dies silently
when the cluster connection drops — this restarts it with backoff until
you press Ctrl-C, timestamping every connect and drop.

.PP
Everything after \fBforward\fR passes to kubectl verbatim:
  le forward svc/frontend 8080:80 -n prod --context minikube


.SH OPTIONS
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for forward


